  "description": "<p>Touch; <strong>40ft radius</strong>, takes <strong>1 hour</strong> to cast, lasts until dispelled.</p><ul><li>Undead and summoned or conjured creatures cannot willingly enter, and allies inside gain +1 to saves against effects from undead or extraplanar creatures.</li><li>Cast reversed (Unhallow): undead inside gain +2 to saves and living non-evil creatures have <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on saves against fear.</li><li>Material: herbs, oils and incense worth 500 gp, consumed.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Reversible:</strong> may be cast as its opposite with the same slot.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Costly component:</strong> see Rare Spell Components in the Shopkeeper's Catalogue.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric</p>",
